# Cloudflare Pages security headers for ஜோதிட நிபுணர்.
# These are safe defaults that do not break Firebase Auth / reCAPTCHA.
# A Content-Security-Policy is intentionally left out here because it must
# be tuned to your exact Firebase project + Worker domain and TESTED with
# phone-auth/reCAPTCHA before enabling — see docs/SECURITY-DEPLOY.md.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
